Subject: the hall of fame name and the copy protection answer can come from the frontend

Two weak hooks, each a no-op in SDLPoP2's own build: hof_given_name()
gives the name the hall of fame asks for, typed into the editor as its
keys would have typed it, for a frontend with no letter keys; and
cp_action_pressed() lets the action button choose the copy protection's
symbol as Enter does.

diff --git a/source/menu.c b/source/menu.c
index 3d75688..f634d3f 100644
--- a/source/menu.c
+++ b/source/menu.c
@@ -462,11 +462,19 @@ static void hof_screen(const hof_list *h)   /* 0D5E:17F2 */
 		text_shadowed(just, &r, NULL, 0, 10, t);
 	}
